# modules_b.tcyr — per-module suite, second part. Split from tests/modules.tcyr in 3.3.4:
#                  at 1.15 MB the single file passed cyrlint/cyrfmt's 1028 KB input cap, so
#                  CI's lint and fmt gates could not read it. Same includes, tolerances and
#                  helpers as modules.tcyr, plus the fixtures its own groups reuse. In 3.3.7,
#                  at 908 KB, its groups from "3.3.5: perlin_2d / perlin_3d past 2^63" on
#                  moved to tests/modules_c.tcyr.
# The live assertion count is published per suite in docs/guides/testing.md.
# [measured: CHANGELOG.md 3.3.4, the modules.tcyr split (1.15 MB against cyrlint/cyrfmt's 1028 KB cap)]
# [measured: wc -c tests/modules_b.tcyr on the 3.3.6 tree, 908,223 B]

